		'''
		Replaces your grappling hook with the ability to glitch
		Press {0} to glitch with a {1} second cooldown
		Glitching teleports you to your cursor and causes all entities to freeze for {2} seconds
		Pressing {0} while glitched will telport you to your cursor and unfreeze the game
